137	// ListPersonalAccessTokens retrieves all Personal Access Tokens (PATs) for a user.
138	//
139	// Personal Access Tokens are used for:
140	// - Mobile app authentication
141	// - CLI tool authentication
142	// - API client authentication
143	// - Any programmatic access requiring Bearer token auth
144	//
145	// Security:
146	// - Only the token owner can list their tokens
147	// - Returns token metadata only (not the actual token value)
148	// - Invalid or expired tokens are filtered out
149	//
150	// Authentication: Required (session cookie or access token)
